n relates; then:  Amendments  Schedule 1  No. 12, 2017 Privacy Amendment (Notifiable Data Breaches) Act 2017  (c) the access or disclosure covered by paragraph (a), or the loss covered by paragraph (b), is an eligible data breach of the APP entity, credit reporting body, credit provider or file number recipient, as the case may be; and  (d) an individual covered by subparagraph (a)(ii) or (b)(ii) is at risk from the eligible data breach.  (3) Subsection (2) has effect subject to section 26WF." ;
    cof:pageNumber "9"^^xsd:integer .

