concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wg cml:asserts concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wg-logic-alleninterval-2 .
concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wg-logic-alleninterval-2 a cml:LogicApplication ;
