doc:sch-1-sec-26wh-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "26WH(1) Assessment of suspected eligible data breach" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section applies if:  (a) an entity is aware that there are reasonable grounds to suspect that there may have been an eligible data breach of the entity; and  (b) the entity is not aware that there are reasonable grounds to believe that the relevant circumstances amount to an eligible data breach of the entity. Assessment" ;
    cof:pageNumber "15"^^xsd:integer .

concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wh-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26WH(2) Assessment of suspected eligible data breach"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-26wh-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The entity must:  (a) carry out a reasonable and expeditious assessment of whether there are reasonable grounds to believe that the relevant circumstances amount to an eligible data breach of the entity; and  (b) take all reasonable steps to ensure that the assessment is completed within 30 days after the entity becomes aware as mentioned in paragraph (1)(a). Note: Section 26WK applies if an entity is aware that there are reasonable grounds to believe that there has been an eligible data breach of the entity." ;
    skos:definition "(2) The entity must:  (a) carry out a reasonable and expeditious assessment of whether there are reasonable grounds to believe that the relevant circumstances amount to an eligible data breach of the entity; and  (b) take all reasonable steps to ensure that the assessment is completed within 30 days after the entity becomes aware as mentioned in paragraph (1)(a). Note: Section 26WK applies if an entity is aware that there are reasonable grounds to believe that there has been an eligible data breach of the entity."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f4479a7b79dceaf986c15d162d3611096cf768a1a5beb11b6ac837d692f543bb" ;
    values:partOf concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wh ;
    cof:pageNumber "15"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Entity must carry out assessment and take steps to ensure completion within 30 days." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017.pdf> ;
