    skos:definition "(3) The statement referred to in subparagraph (2)(a)(i) must set out:  (a) the identity and contact details of the entity; and  (b) a description of the eligible data breach that the entity has reasonable grounds to believe has happened; and  (c) the kind or kinds of information concerned; and  (d) recommendations about the steps that individuals should take in response to the eligible data breach that the entity has reasonable grounds to believe has happened."@en ;
