concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wq-ss-9 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26WQ(9) Exception—declaration by Commissioner"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-26wq-ss-9 ;
    values:originalText "(9) If an entity applies to the Commissioner under paragraph (5)(b) for a declaration that, to any extent, relates to an eligible data breach of the entity, sections 26WK and 26WL do not apply in relation to:  (a) the eligible data breach; or  (b) if the access, disclosure or loss that constituted the eligible data breach of the entity is an eligible data breach of one or more other entities—such an eligible data breach of those other entities; until the Commissioner makes a decision in response to the application for the declaration." ;
    skos:definition "(9) If an entity applies to the Commissioner under paragraph (5)(b) for a declaration that, to any extent, relates to an eligible data breach of the entity, sections 26WK and 26WL do not apply in relation to:  (a) the eligible data breach; or  (b) if the access, disclosure or loss that constituted the eligible data breach of the entity is an eligible data breach of one or more other entities—such an eligible data breach of those other entities; until the Commissioner makes a decision in response to the application for the declaration."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "84589b056d45b211d6d0dd0848ba90f56c4c351043a0a7a8b176d8265cfdb952" ;
    values:partOf concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wq ;
    cof:pageNumber "19"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Exemption from sections 26WK and 26WL for eligible data breach declarations" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017.pdf> ;
    dc:source "privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017.pdf, p.19" ;
    cml:asserts concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wq-ss-9-norm .
