concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wq-ss-10 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26WQ(10) Exception—declaration by Commissioner"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-26wq-ss-10 ;
    values:originalText "(10) An entity is not entitled to make an application under paragraph (5)(b) in relation to an eligible data breach of the entity if:  (a) the access, disclosure or loss that constituted the eligible data breach of the entity is an eligible data breach of one or more other entities; and  Schedule 1  Amendments  Privacy Amendment (Notifiable Data Breaches) Act 2017 No. 12, 2017  (b) one of those other entities has already made an application under paragraph (5)(b) in relation to the eligible data breach of the other entity. Extension of specified period" ;
    skos:definition "(10) An entity is not entitled to make an application under paragraph (5)(b) in relation to an eligible data breach of the entity if:  (a) the access, disclosure or loss that constituted the eligible data breach of the entity is an eligible data breach of one or more other entities; and  Schedule 1  Amendments  Privacy Amendment (Notifiable Data Breaches) Act 2017 No. 12, 2017  (b) one of those other entities has already made an application under paragraph (5)(b) in relation to the eligible data breach of the other entity. Extension of specified period"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3e6c3bfcf84401e8de33e25701c8aeb68f41f65c15e6d0aba4ddd5aabe26a594" ;
    values:partOf concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wq ;
    cof:pageNumber "19"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Entity cannot apply for data breach compensation if another entity has already applied." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017.pdf> ;
