concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wq-ss-11 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26WQ(11) Exception—declaration by Commissioner"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-26wq-ss-11 ;
    values:originalText "(11) If notice of a paragraph (1)(d) declaration has been given to an entity, the Commissioner may, by written notice given to the entity, extend the period specified in the declaration. Subdivision C—Commissioner may direct entity to notify eligible data breach" ;
    skos:definition "(11) If notice of a paragraph (1)(d) declaration has been given to an entity, the Commissioner may, by written notice given to the entity, extend the period specified in the declaration. Subdivision C—Commissioner may direct entity to notify eligible data breach"@en ;
