concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wr-ss-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26WR(8) Commissioner may direct entity to notify eligible data breach"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-26wr-ss-8 ;
    values:originalText "(8) If the Commissioner is aware that there are reasonable grounds to believe that the access, disclosure or loss that constituted the eligible data breach of the entity is an eligible data breach of one or  Schedule 1  Amendments  Privacy Amendment (Notifiable Data Breaches) Act 2017 No. 12, 2017  more other entities, a direction under subsection (1) may also require the statement referred to in paragraph (1)(a) to set out the identity and contact details of those other entities. Method of providing a statement to an individual" ;
    skos:definition "(8) If the Commissioner is aware that there are reasonable grounds to believe that the access, disclosure or loss that constituted the eligible data breach of the entity is an eligible data breach of one or  Schedule 1  Amendments  Privacy Amendment (Notifiable Data Breaches) Act 2017 No. 12, 2017  more other entities, a direction under subsection (1) may also require the statement referred to in paragraph (1)(a) to set out the identity and contact details of those other entities. Method of providing a statement to an individual"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ffc69aeccf69e05e6410415ac624e92ff5266cb412c4311be7ac51caae8bff2b" ;
    values:partOf concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wr ;
    cof:pageNumber "22"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Entity must notify eligible data breach and provide additional information if required by the Commissioner." ;
    dc:description "Yes" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
