concept:privacy-amendment-notifiable-data-breaches-act-2017-sch-1-sec-26wt-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26WT(5) Exception—inconsistency with secrecy provisions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-26wt-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) If compliance by an entity with paragraph 26WR(1)(b) or subsection 26WR(2) in relation to a statement would, to any extent, be inconsistent with a prescribed secrecy provision, paragraph 26WR(1)(b) or subsection 26WR(2), as the case may be, does not apply to the entity in relation to the statement." ;
    skos:definition "(5) If compliance by an entity with paragraph 26WR(1)(b) or subsection 26WR(2) in relation to a statement would, to any extent, be inconsistent with a prescribed secrecy provision, paragraph 26WR(1)(b) or subsection 26WR(2), as the case may be, does not apply to the entity in relation to the statement."@en ;
